# Design System — {{.ProjectTitle}}

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **This document is the single source of truth for all UI decisions.**
> Before creating any new component or writing any CSS, read this file first.
> Non-compliance (plain colors, no animations, unstyled states) is **not acceptable**.

---

## Tech Stack

| Concern | Library | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Styling | **Tailwind CSS v4** | Utility-first, config in `tailwind.config.ts` |
| Component Base | **shadcn/ui** | Radix UI primitives + Tailwind, copy-paste approach |
| Headless Primitives | **Radix UI** | Accessibility-first, unstyled — used via shadcn/ui |
| Animations | **Framer Motion** | Spring physics, layout animations, gesture support |
| Variant Styling | **class-variance-authority (CVA)** | Type-safe component variants |
| Icons | **lucide-react** | Curated, consistent, tree-shakeable |
| Notifications | **sonner** | Beautiful toast notifications |
| Dark Mode | **next-themes** | CSS variable-based, SSR-safe |
| Forms | **react-hook-form + zod** | Uncontrolled forms + schema validation |
| Server State | **TanStack Query v5** | Fetching, caching, invalidation |
| Client State | **zustand** | Minimal global state |
| Date Utilities | **date-fns** | Tree-shakeable, immutable |
| URL State | **nuqs** | Type-safe URL search params (Next.js) |

