```

**Naming Conventions:**

| Level | Pattern | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Atom | `PascalCase` noun | `Button`, `Avatar`, `Badge` |
| Molecule | `PascalCase` noun phrase | `UserCard`, `SearchInput`, `FormGroup` |
| Organism | `PascalCase` domain noun | `DashboardSidebar`, `UserDataTable` |
| Template | `PascalCase` + `Layout` suffix | `DashboardLayout`, `AuthLayout` |
| Page | `PascalCase` + `Page` suffix | `LoginPage`, `DashboardPage` |

**File Structure per Component:**
```
ComponentName/
├── ComponentName.tsx       # Component implementation
├── ComponentName.test.tsx  # Unit tests
├── ComponentName.types.ts  # Props types (if complex)
└── index.ts                # Re-export
```

