## State Management Rules

| State Type | Solution | Rule |
|---|---|---|
| Server data (API) | **TanStack Query** | All API calls MUST go through `useQuery` / `useMutation` |
| Global UI state | **zustand** | Auth state, theme, sidebar open/close, global modals |
| Local UI state | **`useState`** | Ephemeral state: dropdown open, hover, form input focus |
| URL / filter state | **nuqs** (Next.js) | Search params, pagination, filters — persist in URL |
| Form state | **react-hook-form** | All form fields — NEVER use `useState` for form inputs |

```typescript
// TanStack Query — fetch pattern
function useUsers(filters: UserFilters) {
  return useQuery({
    queryKey: ["users", filters],
    queryFn: () => userApi.getUsers(filters),
    staleTime: 30_000, // 30 seconds
  });
}

// TanStack Query — mutation pattern
function useCreateUser() {
  const queryClient = useQueryClient();
  return useMutation({
    mutationFn: userApi.createUser,
    onSuccess: () => {
      queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: ["users"] });
      toast.success("User created successfully");
    },
    onError: (error) => {
      toast.error(error.message ?? "Failed to create user");
    },
  });
}
```

