## shadcn/ui Integration Rules

1. **Add components via CLI only:**
   ```bash
   npx shadcn@latest add button
   npx shadcn@latest add input card dialog
   ```

2. **Never modify files in `src/components/ui/` directly.** These are generated.
   Extend by creating a wrapper in `src/components/atoms/` or `src/components/molecules/`.

3. **Extend via CVA, not via className overrides:**
   ```typescript
   // ✅ Good — extend in your atom layer
   const myButtonVariants = cva("...", { variants: { ... } });

   // ❌ Bad — override shadcn internals
   <Button className="!bg-red-500 !rounded-none" />
   ```

4. **All shadcn/ui components must be customized via CSS variables**, not by changing component files.

